ocol is also complete: it captured a healthy pre-restart state and boot identity, restart acknowledgement, a different post-restart identity, and recovered system and workspace behavior. The fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the identity change.","limitations":["The creation probes used release-team as the process's primary group, so they do not independently distinguish directory inheritance from ordinary process-group ownership. Direct observation of mode 2775 nevertheless establishes the setgid configuration responsible for inheritance."]}
